    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016700/extras/51549134ac987d9b1d69d3ad2eb396db.poster.avif?t=1731186971\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016700/extras/51549134ac987d9b1d69d3ad2eb396db.webm?t=1731186971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>For whoever reads this message: I'm looking for humans.... real humans. You know, the ones that have soul! <br><br>Soultifity is the only thing that can save us right now. Can you help us?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016700/extras/eb725bb446ea6ca291b8b716cf1a2ee7.poster.avif?t=1731186971\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016700/extras/eb725bb446ea6ca291b8b716cf1a2ee7.apng?t=1731186971\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016700/extras/93d556caa882dfad7806beda8b6e3689.poster.avif?t=1731186971\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016700/extras/93d556caa882dfad7806beda8b6e3689.apng?t=1731186971\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Vibe to the music, missing a beat is okay<br></li><li> Liberate the 7 districts and free colorful characters<br></li><li> Defeat the robot leaders and unlock new moves<br></li><li> Dance, loot and shop for new abilities<br></li><li> Fear you don't have the right rhythm? Use freestyle mode!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst